WEBVTT

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:25.200
This jackass...

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.410
...pushed another teammate over the edge
for not listening to him,

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.660
and the kid tried to take his own life.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:33.200
He tried to take his own life?

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:39.790
Yori, stop. Violence isn't the answer.

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:42.410
He's the one who came after me.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:47.040
You know, athletes really
shouldn't cause fights.

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:49.200
Didn't you just say you didn't want any trouble?

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.490
You should thank me for not kicking your ass.

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:56.870
Don't forget what I just said. Get out now.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:58.700
Considering his reaction,

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:02.080
it looks like the rumors might be true.

