00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:44.200
So apparently, this middle
school is called Meisei.

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:46.990
Meisei Academy Middle School.
It's a private school.

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:51.370
It's both a middle school and high school,
and their sports teams are really good.

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:56.290
Apparently, all the Kanto kids
know about this school.

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:58.910
Not like we'd know how that feels.

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:01.240
We don't have that many schools to choose from.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:02.240
Oh, yeah.

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:05.830
After the closing ceremonies at school,
we're gonna head to the city.

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:06.950
Wanna come?

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:08.910
Meisei Academy Middle School

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.580
You think Haijima will come?

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:11.700
You two are all buddy-buddy again, aren't ya?

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:17.660
Um... Yeah, that's about all the info
that I needed. Thanks. Bye.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:20.450
There's no way he'd show up.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:26.160
Meisei Academy boys volleyball suicide attempt

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:31.660
Hey, Haijima. Let's walk home together.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:32.660
Okay?

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:37.950
Yuni. You're not taking a bath yet?

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:40.950
Yeah, one sec. I'll take one now.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:45.700
Episode 2: ' The Best and Worst Playmaker'

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:46.330
Today is the last day of the third term.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:48.870
Just because it's spring break,
do not lose your way.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.120
Prepare for the new school year...

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:52.410
Let's go!

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.040
Hey, Yuni.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:05.120
Haijima's not here?

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:07.450
Haijima didn't come to school today.

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:10.120
Then you'll do. Here.

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:14.080
Ugh. The hell is all this?

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:14.080
Gymnasium

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:14.080
Schedule

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:14.080
During

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:14.080
Spring

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:14.080
Break

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:16.580
Give that to Haijima.

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:21.490
You know, no other club wanted
to practice that much during spring break.

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:24.120
You guys basically got
all the days you asked for.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:29.370
Oh, well, if it isn't Yuni.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.290
H-Hello. Um--

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:34.870
Kimichika. The boy from the head family is here.

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.290
Kimichika.

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:43.620
Y-You seriously asked for all these days...

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:47.490
Some days, we're in both slots.

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:51.200
We're basically practicing
all through spring break.

00:04:55.370 --> 00:05:00.370
S-So, I won't be hanging out
with Yori for a while.

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:04.910
And I'll make sure that the thing
you're worried about doesn't happen.

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:06.870
So, yeah. You know.

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:11.240
Volleyball's getting pretty fun,
so I wanna play it a bit more.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:15.330
So please don't tell me to quit right now.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.830
Wh-What?

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:22.580
The thing he said.

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:27.370
Did you...

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:28.660
Just so you know,

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:33.040
Yori didn't tell me anything else,
and I didn't look anything up.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:38.660
It doesn't matter to me what
all the guys from Tokyo say about you.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:40.950
Why would I trust what some
randos faraway have to say

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:44.200
when you're right in front of me?

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:45.540
So...

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:53.040
I'll decide what I think about you myself.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.200
Kuroba...

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:58.120
Well, see you tomorrow at school.

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:24.540
Next!

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.380
Suzumu # 2 MS

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.380
Monshiro MS

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.160
Yuni?

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:12.160
That's dangerous.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:15.080
You were the one who wasn't
looking where you were going.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.040
You going to club right now?

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.080
Yeah.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.450
Oh-ho...

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:22.700
I see our star athlete is workin' hard.

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:24.790
S-Stop teasing me.

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:29.330
What? I'm not teasing you. This is a compliment.

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:32.200
Then stop talking down to me.

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:34.870
Too bad I can't look down on you, too.

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:38.660
Wh-What? Get back, you weirdo.

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:40.540
Did you get taller again?

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:43.040
Huh? Y-You think so?

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:47.580
One-hundred seventy-nine... on the dot.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:49.830
She's right! I did grow!

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:53.120
Hey, it's 179.2. Don't be stingy.

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:58.040
Tch. We still have a 2.3 cm difference.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.330
I'm definitely gonna go past 180 at this point.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.990
Don't your knees hurt?

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:06.120
I mean, they just feel a little weird.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:08.080
Do yours hurt?

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:10.990
They do. Sometimes it's
so bad that I can't sleep.

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:14.240
Huh... Well, that sucks.

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:16.490
Your carefree face pisses me off.

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:19.950
Gather round. We're gonna have a meeting.

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:25.870
The Prefectural Championship
is July 26th and 27th this year.

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:28.160
So right when summer vacation starts.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:30.620
So that means you'd have time
to mess around if you lose.

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:38.290
But I mean, if we're gonna do this thing,
we should see it through to the end.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:40.790
I asked them about the schedule for last year:

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:43.490
the first day will be rounds one and two.

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:45.830
The second day will be the semi-finals,
the game to see who places third,

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:46.870
and the finals.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:49.950
The top three teams will head
to the Hokushin'etsu Championship.

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:55.160
That's it? No division qualifiers?
Just straight to the prefectural finals?

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:58.790
You must be talking about the qualifiers
right under the Prefectural Championship.

00:08:58.760 --> 00:08:58.800
{=1}Haruyama MS

00:08:58.760 --> 00:08:58.800
{=2}Monshiro MS

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:04.580
So, yeah. We somehow lucked out
and our block doesn't have qualifiers.

