We don't have as many schools
as you did back in Tokyo.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:16.490
So if we win four games, we'll win.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:18.990
If we win three, we'll make it past
the Prefectural Championship.

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:21.700
Wait, maybe we can actually do this...

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:21.700
We can do this.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:24.700
We're going to win this thing.

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:28.580
We're gonna win the Hokushin'etsu
Championship... and go to nationals!

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:33.830
Why is he so...

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:37.450
Our team hasn't even played
an official match once yet.

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:43.660
But nationals, huh?

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:50.080
"[Rotation] Every time a team gets a turn to
serve, each player moves one position over
clockwise, so the right front player goes
to the back right and can serve."

