Yes!

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:07.950
Yuni!

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:11.080
That's way too cool!

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:11.080
He did it again... Wow.

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:12.870
The heck was that spike?

00:10:12.870 --> 00:10:15.240
That was all the setter.

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:17.240
Their setter's too good.

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:28.660
Kuroba!

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:34.450
Yuni!

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:36.990
You're on fire today!

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.240
